---

## 15. Conclusion

The architecture separates advertisement definition, surface constraints, layout calculation, and rendering.

The same advertisement specification can therefore be processed for different surfaces without creating a separate hardcoded layout for each one.

The resolver is the central component responsible for producing a valid layout while respecting available space, element priorities, minimum dimensions, safe areas, and overlap constraints.

This structure also makes the project easier to extend, test, and maintain.
